    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2276a42a57739fee0c154d7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，我在模拟赛的时候……确实感受到迷惘没错。那种\n从来不曾感受过的被锁定的焦虑，让我有种无法自由发挥的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9979a2df657d0abcb902165b493005c466e56060e49f4e5ab96475a737adfe4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da410796fb3f6aea3a16f88e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便如此，大家还是对你有顾忌吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "07aac6e68e5fffdfeb0498a24b9aca20c278b7a6c288f1b8f02ecd7722b169ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
