    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f9c215920c220239be8334",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我从小就都有跟一起训练的人交待过，\n“并跑练习的时候一定不能对我放水”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa8a93027c4cd338de7f1b0be3693efb7548d43030454f3fa091c58c15b96149",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6193cdaf1570e2132979d14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9001c462cda02e04688042965b70cf8db0bfc021e262b0efa9c3c3adc791b7da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68fa285caf8b4b66656e9d49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我懂。这就是出身差距的问题吧。因为多了一层\n主仆的关系，就算对方不觉得有放水，却也做不到强势压制……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef9727f2409aa75b449028ab65dd6ccd902adda701cdbaba695a21d9d1bc9ff4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7fb4af2c2bf8bdd405d4f35",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还有一个问题，那就是你太容易失去冷静了",
      "source_fingerprint": "6538678b1ebc5a45f99988cb4026d473ce26b723074b87af94bc6be86e22ec3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
