    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26dafdd326d480e07c52f3bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原、原来如此～这我还真的没有想过……！\n所以我才会从其他选手身上感受到压力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32e8143727353ddd9b93720153069f143423c6aa3b1c8c43071de9d6991b3b44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18eb002b290a3e0b34ed3000",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新人训练员A",
      "source_fingerprint": "e829f9d4dc056512054ee3af7d16ee643fea041192ab34f55f5b5f4bdc406a95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:029c59eac6005a37f8b36229",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那到时候会场上见了。啊，对了，你知道吗？\n上次里见光钻的训练员征选的结果……",
      "source_fingerprint": "88e92dcc8944e7bbdea5ee7d6f9d2ccdcc6d4f0e39576998d15f2ae992b23ba3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc8f2e9deec97dd76a14f8e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻",
      "source_fingerprint": "a913b033e75912b0a4cb7963f7e72669b709a7ceab5f45934f12e6bb61efe713",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:329f07c48232db845992f281",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咦……失去冷静？这好像是第一次有人这样跟我说……\n那是指怎么一回事呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "baf424a2943adafeec8b0cb6d5e7314165879d49a12571cddb91c4f39ec64a36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5651c471915a0de16785123",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我把自己在比赛中观察到的事情告诉她。比赛中期，\n还需要忍耐的时候，会因为跟一旁选手的竞争而加快步调。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7243612e01a27f13165556a2974992bd00397e5f4140f4fa65218f7de5eb88eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fc07792309859662cc4ebd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就是失去冷静而导致的。\n那是藏在她千金身份底下，她最真实的个性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ca188b7b5f151c99a5d10ae3c13242b71132de6d95ba52a71b397c8994a5621",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b01cce672c5afe6b4df4dce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻",
      "source_fingerprint": "a913b033e75912b0a4cb7963f7e72669b709a7ceab5f45934f12e6bb61efe713",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
