    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7c1e20ddb175bb480a7cd89",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──！？那时候我的确因为想要到更前面的位置，\n脚一直蠢蠢欲动的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed891e255c9176ec1fddf0348f48b237ea232e6d76416844756d4ea0731aef2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
