    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92cddb2eba3aa22429c9c08f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我还是立刻就忍下来了。明明有忍住的……\n仅仅一瞬间的步调加快，你却……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fae09a33803538e0c6910d01b428097e8b3cb5cf32cbfe4f5f6334c914f0e587",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:321ec23c7ce8a95fb8922d74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是因为我真的被你的表现给深深吸引住了",
      "source_fingerprint": "3598f590dfa2bae105dc81ee34385b7288b481dae876ad44b8bddd3d1d2fcfca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fbf2dd9a08a8bedc0da54d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是因为我真的被你的表现给深深吸引住了哟",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b35522e65f515e4a7ee934e333359745c7437656c1b5eda20845577ac11a8f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
