    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc99588a58a69aa3a5af9fe9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你……到底是何方神圣呢？\n仅仅一场比赛就让你对我的状况了若指掌……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c38640c8eb59d99345f6e021aa2630962f7c0735237dfb34c6aa8c917c7536bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92ac0c839ae001fbc4f9dcc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为深受吸引，所以才能瞬间就看到她的长处与短处。\n虽然我对她的家族不了解，却瞬间就看透了她的本质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b807a7672848dc829d42cc9a8f7eee2361d7b58a892d365207ab77838f193175",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
