      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咦咦？里见！？你应该明白吧？\n你的训练员对里见集团来说是多慎重的一件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a04796f31e211fe48a1cd6b876fef9dd65f4ad6f22d1341f793a210d6f07dd",
