      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不应该凭感觉就这样仓促做决定！\n还是先回去跟大家好好商量──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0d8b768d3853fe8051a5d5a62921c4348e2c1d1e5f7b6b8d78beca7cab73d6c",
