      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，我已经决定了。就算是被我尊敬的麦昆劝说，\n唯独这件事，我是绝不会改变心意的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37c215518c74efd9f1c8e0ea858ab6d28e8b9f1b745aaf1ae33be2507f1dba43",
