      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "需要获得全家族的同意──一定也是个魔咒。那不如相信直觉，\n破除这个魔咒！无论谁说什么，你就是我的训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d862cb71a3a9a3c678bab4cc8fd0eae1c84466c7796efc8d61fbf32bba915383",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
