      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了派对当天。\n我在会场看见正热衷于多人游戏的里见光钻和北部玄驹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a17a7648a0fb21b0c188924a105fc5dd23ac8c1557dced047a00f4f4f0093b14",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
