      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咦咦咦，黑白棋是角落被占走就会输的游戏吧？\n那小钻怎么还下在那个位置啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a3e9ca28c603c3be0ca1498c0fe8c689c1aaaf16936f47e6e48798b16ad967c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
